{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "d8ded7f489d64d52680590aefe467d772f2311ac23fdd5e7c45b908e819178ea", "ja": "自分、カンペキなリーダーだぞ！", "zh": "本人是完美的队长喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "eb83f04df8b17c883803d9c2fbfc7f311ee733de1b4cf59024f2d217e8f332cc", "ja": "期待の新ユニット、レジェンドデイズ。\n響のリーダー任命は、他のメンバー達に\n受け入れられ、5人は仲良く好調な\nスタートを切るのだった。", "zh": "备受期待的新团体──『Legend Days』。\n其他成员同意由响担任队长，\n五人和乐融融，\n有了一个顺利的开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e4d158bcd29d637cabc03b2b9854342742758e6934a02db3f4d918917aaea828", "ja": "（今日はレジェンドデイズの初ミーティングだ。　\nさて、もうみんな集まってるかな……）", "zh": "（今天是『Legend Days』第一次开会。\n大家已经到齐了吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "591d15cd3419f9569c3a92982c05863f083d35bf536c60aac3ea2c209d293fa7", "ja": "みんな！　おはよう！", "zh": "各位！你们早啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "858b2ab37af57939352a7a35c5f4e753e04f371f29581421d3ff9af1e0b6cf74", "ja": "おはようございま～す！", "zh": "早安～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "bc4e77e6407e004b7c8b2f83de56da665396ef3fa2d64a5a518fd7a82fdcab61", "ja": "おはようございます。", "zh": "早安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "93aeab8c0ebb35bd496d599ecbcafbe4581d794c2cbfeb08d6538dac01185e48", "ja": "オハオハー♪", "zh": "早啊早啊──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "1d06a41abaf1166b22bd057b30eef61f59b10b6dfa4a20efdaedcad82721ba32", "ja": "おはよう♪", "zh": "早安♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "ae74cfa08a9f6de7909805b3e75b7aad22d8081e242e347a73c1c05628c84f54", "ja": "おはようございまーすっ！", "zh": "早安──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "22082d884487589acd8f22d09d0c07c662fa9ed2fbd5bf7d10fbff747b8e5369", "ja": "青羽さんから聞いてると思うけど、今日からこの\nメンバーで、新しいユニットを組むことになった。", "zh": "你们应该已经听青羽小姐说过了，\n今天开始要以在场成员组成新团体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9a1ab85427d3da38a5fabcfe2f80685c12630b52552df1d28aadbeca2e88c595", "ja": "その名も『レジェンドデイズ』だ。頑張っていこうな！\nというわけで、さっそくミーティングを……。", "zh": "团体名字是『Legend Days』，让我们一起加油吧！\n那么，我们马上就开始会议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "751f11755ca146c76f57e863eba61951427ec8d17f96e28a3f7486181fd54ba7", "ja": "ちょっと！　勝手に話を進めないでよね。　\nまだ一番肝心なことを聞いてないわよ？", "zh": "等等！不要擅自开始会议，\n你还没告诉我们最关键的事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4f373e0cfe97c96dd072e0c688be63f95b04ecba9fe762f1c443a989eeb26b3f", "ja": "ん？　肝心なことってなんだ、伊織？", "zh": "嗯？最关键的事是指什么，伊织？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "356ac348fc826678d4c16025bbbe89b28ab97dd70bd456c6ad09dba007982eae", "ja": "もう、何とぼけたコト言ってるのかしら。リーダーよ、\nリーダー！　誰がこのユニットのリーダーなの？", "zh": "真是的，你在装什么傻啊？我指的当然是队长！\n这个团体的队长是谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a4a23ff630986ded56ebf0c2e3868414bcf2909885489648de3f4c67b303a80b", "ja": "あれ？　言ってなかったか……。\n俺としたことが、すまん。", "zh": "咦？我没说过吗……\n我居然会犯这种错，抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "c52cc3c2449fac7a880012a961fff5da3acd795ed93fb890bb8369c0a8fd357a", "ja": "んっふっふ～、知ってるよ兄ちゃん、\nリーダーはゼッタイ、亜美に決まってるっしょ♪", "zh": "嗯哼哼～亚美知道喔，大哥哥。\n队长一定是亚美对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "e9d134f79b18d41e3d09caa7da1e011348bda0f6c5acabcf1852228f28f95119", "ja": "えへへ、もし本当にそうなら、\n楽しいユニットになりそうかなーって！", "zh": "嘿嘿，如果真的是这样，\n感觉会是一个很欢乐的团体吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "e91e30c5a617d8638db97799a2347b64a7000c0f5040c380f46ab79b1d1b3467", "ja": "楽しそうすぎて危険な香りしかしないわね。\n手堅く行きたいなら、私が引き受けますよ？", "zh": "我只觉得会欢乐过头，散发出危险的气息。\n如果想要稳扎稳打，可以交给我喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5e9c8faeb02409f98fff970f775d48486b17094bcfeab978bed605b80a6394e6", "ja": "いや、申し訳ないんだけど、今回のリーダーは\n亜美でも律子でもない。もう決まっていてだな……。", "zh": "不，真是不好意思，这次的队长已经决定好了，\n不是亚美，也不是律子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "8e60fa438629fc5bf7bcf64b4fa59c90d7c1571239c6fee81cc23f0333a051d6", "ja": "うっ、う……ひっ……ひひ、ひ……\nこ、こら、ハム……いま大事な話……ふふふ……！", "zh": "唔、呜……嘻……嘻嘻、嘻……别、别闹了，\n哈姆……现在说的事很重要……呵呵呵……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "c180d5bbb10a932a996ca87fe686856a3ddfe2f06b3ea388b0223a0c3b41b79a", "ja": "あは、あははは！　\nくすぐったいぞー！", "zh": "啊哈、啊哈哈哈！\n很痒啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "f97361bd1fdc3749908c2042eb40ab52506ebe31a0f38f639b622c2b3aeccc73", "ja": "えっ、まさか響なの？　……って、なんだか、\n大変なことになってるみたいだけど。", "zh": "咦？难道是响吗？\n……等等，她的状况好像不太妙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "ec1d01d6a981efeed3bb50d35491d154f7395084715ee60768260a789ef5761a", "ja": "あは、あははは！　あはは……！", "zh": "啊哈、啊哈哈哈！啊哈哈……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "63deb251bd76b156f1a783061c41bc19e9f4cffbe1109e7137207547d50d2afb", "ja": "お、おい響、大丈夫か？\nワライダケでも食べたのか……？", "zh": "喂、喂，响，你还好吗？\n你是吃了笑菇吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "07a76c0dab5a1a6fb46b3fdf3ab99024c9124f5d8d565669d4e67df52785ebae", "ja": "ち、違うぞ、あはは、ハム蔵が服の中に入って……\nやめるんだー、ハム蔵！　あはははっ！", "zh": "不、不是啦，啊哈哈，是哈姆藏跑到衣服里……\n别这样啦──哈姆藏！啊哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "83a7f6f1d588dcd5c2a7d6ec1c43d234a088bbf9af50f786f2e202ad700b5094", "ja": "ひ、響、ちょっとガマンしろよ！\nこら、ハム蔵！　仕事中は大人しくしてなさい！", "zh": "哇！响，你忍耐一下！\n好了，哈姆藏！我们在工作时你要安分一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1024_hamuzou", "source_sha256": "b54c506c84a5b6a0de2bf3cf6c1c3f1710c278ea6b9c40aa4017b770f392c2ea", "ja": "ギュッ……。", "zh": "啾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "d502a03a030e7909d35a0c0de6b2a16092a39f105c8f8640c4dc52fc598bb42a", "ja": "……ふう、取れたかな。", "zh": "……呼，抓出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1026_013hib", "source_sha256": "154675b67513742ff9ec204335f20fa084081bc793b67dce0e2c5a4dbc3e71b7", "ja": "ふう、ひい……し、死ぬかと思ったぞ……。\nありがとね、{$P$}！", "zh": "呼、呼……本、本人还以为要死了……\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "10976d836d3aea4f64140befcd36c1772e4f18cd16b1bf788da0461b4455c5af", "ja": "はあ、リーダーが最初からこんな調子じゃ、\n先が思いやられるわね……。", "zh": "唉，队长从一开始就这样，\n真是前途堪忧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "3f37450206614591310cf5108fef5e75e5b50a8248cb3979ea50d98b6937c523", "ja": "え？　リーダーって……\nええっ、もしかして、自分がリーダーなの！？", "zh": "咦？你说队长……\n什么？难道本人是队长吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "fbfedc78cfc004a0426700a6b735d4f9aa3f845c4b8093d5aad24f58b70eb5d7", "ja": "ああ、レジェンドデイズのリーダーを、\n響に頼みたいんだ。どうだ？　やってくれるか？", "zh": "对，我想拜托你担任『Legend Days』的队长。\n怎么样？你愿意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1030_013hib", "source_sha256": "ecdb0d5e0f9fa8ff76d2bf813404d1a916b1883fa336467fb357b58afe4303b8", "ja": "え、えっと……うん、大丈夫さー！\nえへへ……自分を選んでくれて、うれしいぞっ！", "zh": "这、这个……嗯，没问题啦──！\n嘿嘿……本人很高兴被选上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1031_013hib", "source_sha256": "a9ad97e6b2a1aec93c6a594e9b1b9823dced0e9f0b9de83e47e51724c2a2a15a", "ja": "よーし、そうと決まれば、カンペキにリーダーやって、\n一番のユニットにしてみせるさー！", "zh": "好～既然决定了，本人会做个完美的队长，\n带领大家成为最棒的团体啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1032_007ior", "source_sha256": "14d885ffdcec2cfe7876623a27f59c6137e9256a0e9a4761f8c60a9bd0eb5541", "ja": "一番になるのは当然でしょ。このメンバーなら、\n誰にも負ける気はしないもの……にひひっ♪", "zh": "我们当然会是最棒的。有这些成员在，\n根本不会输给任何人……咿嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1033_005yay", "source_sha256": "5c63560286054fc1b9ec2d8f89a288d28f1c2baa8dcdcaa9b92fbdbf17a34188", "ja": "うっうー！　楽しみだねっ、伊織ちゃん！\n私も全力で、がんばりまーっす！！", "zh": "呜呜──！好期待喔，伊织！\n我也会全力以赴──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1034_011ami", "source_sha256": "98c4e7ec62f475b7c80b2270800a9b4feca2c2140fd7930af0cae1e72e82192d", "ja": "でもさー、いおりんと律っちゃんが一緒だと、亜美、\nカンタンにフザケられないよ？　どうすんの兄ちゃん？", "zh": "可是啊──有伊织儿和小律在，亚美就不能\n随便开玩笑了。你说怎么办啊，大哥哥？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "d836cde6fc36a94d619668b9f6af14aa81925d004a2a0b746c3e57135dba95d5", "ja": "……いや、どうもしなくていいぞ？", "zh": "……不，我想没有怎么办。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1036_009rit", "source_sha256": "18ad08a8b0d2803f79834ef2af35e9477aa3268250dbb6b5142eff0499b559e7", "ja": "ふふっ、そりゃもうしっかりと見張ってますからね！\nさてと……、では、{$P$}。", "zh": "呵呵，我一定会好好监督你的！\n那么……{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1037_009rit", "source_sha256": "ff1845c8d5a81eaaef5e4f2742f7ddde5810aba75012fe41522e9278620e44e8", "ja": "最初はユニットの方向性を話し合うんですよね？\n市場のニーズを踏まえて、戦略的に決定しましょうか。", "zh": "一开始要先讨论团体的路线吧？\n针对市场需求，决定好战略吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1038_013hib", "source_sha256": "c98bf1c8a49279bade2524e46c06ffa02c6cb1cf1f8ed608cb5e5f4581e94d6c", "ja": "し、市場？　ニーズ……？\n自分、よくわかんないけど……なんくるないさー！", "zh": "市、市场？需求……？\n本人听不太懂……但总会有办法的啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1039_007ior", "source_sha256": "6dbdd7c550ee7876c042500a0f9dcfeceb7ac56d46c4a17f07d5df6acbd982df", "ja": "なんくるあるのっ！　リーダーなら、\nちょっとはマジメに考えなさいよね。", "zh": "不是什么都有办法！\n你既然是队长，就要好好认真考虑一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1040_p", "source_sha256": "17ed5b7e6f4c5515e334c6edff3b915e26002a193ef0532b78acc10fb6f8e124", "ja": "まあまあ伊織。俺は、今回に限っては、\n無理に方向性を決める必要はないと思うんだ。", "zh": "别担心，伊织。\n我觉得这次不需要勉强决定路线。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "9627ced81f87d728debf13f0b327325261f7c74466ea4ff479be0c18658ec962", "ja": "5人とも、ちゃんとアイドル活動の経験があるだろ？\n方向性も、ある程度は定まってるよな。", "zh": "你们五人在偶像圈不是都有过历练了吗？\n你们的路线在某个程度上已经定下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1042_007ior", "source_sha256": "24693da1073c12fbc6bffb82f83c87cc8f57a5c32891d762dc1d74846f73eecc", "ja": "まあ……それはそうね。それで？", "zh": "嗯……这么说也对。然后呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1043_p", "source_sha256": "fdadb1650b11bd65f88c773a7534df4ae98ddab2506b80b8c1a0f08467e93249", "ja": "これまで一緒に活動する機会も多かったから、\n意志疎通もコンビネーションも問題ない。だから……", "zh": "你们以前一起活动的机会也很多，\n在沟通想法和默契上都没有问题，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1044_p", "source_sha256": "f7da79dca450ab43ecf1c80ed103b1b6dabefaf12fcb30094ef7cefbd6885ae2", "ja": "むしろ、最初にあれこれと全部、\n決めてしまわない方がいいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "不要在一开始就把所有事情都定下来，\n会不会反而比较好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1045_009rit", "source_sha256": "26409ba8fa839e40b44bb92f5485bfc019462d63b5a3186f82b1faa55840157f", "ja": "ふーむ。つまり、先にコンセプトを決めて、\nそれに合わせていくんじゃなく……。", "zh": "嗯……也就是说，\n不要先决定好主题然后去配合……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1046_009rit", "source_sha256": "5c8ec4c0867806737c82719552608ec1321f861999f1b91d5d67221bc88ae57f", "ja": "活動していく中で、私達ならではの持ち味、コンセプト\nを見つけていく、と……。ふふっ、面白そうね！", "zh": "而是要在活动中渐渐发掘我们独特的风格和主题……\n呵呵，似乎很有趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1047_011ami", "source_sha256": "b48d4251469c9c08af47d216f51ff663f99bb1add0543e1a17eae7733c1aede8", "ja": "てことは、もう好きにしていいってことだよね！\nさっすが兄ちゃん、わかってますな～♪", "zh": "换句话说，大家都可以随心所欲对吧！\n不愧是大哥哥，真懂呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1048_p", "source_sha256": "323cb025a4c392ceca10157b50db2f49147954dd0217d601e0a3422b622ac441", "ja": "はは、簡単にいうと、そういうことだ。\nでも、サボッたりはしないでくれよ。", "zh": "哈哈，简单来说就是这样，\n但你们可别偷懒喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1049_005yay", "source_sha256": "3888db476210e89d159fcb8ef94254dad6045bfb59d6163511499e95ce890167", "ja": "はいっ。私、難しいことはあんまりわかんないかもです\nけど、そのぶん、一生懸命レッスンしまーす！", "zh": "好的。我可能听不懂太难的事情，\n但我会更努力练习──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1050_p", "source_sha256": "db02b02ac7ba55cb62f73aa0ba913bcfb2e068ccb84d873e58945ca45eb44090", "ja": "ああ、頼んだぞ、やよい！　……よし、顔合わせは\nこのくらいにして、もうレッスンに入ろうか。", "zh": "嗯，拜托你了，弥生！……好，\n成员初次会面就到此为止，你们开始练习吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1051_013hib", "source_sha256": "5615b73fc61578bc5a33b935679a79f496752e00d885b0d5a71f5472900e9c15", "ja": "うんっ！　いろいろ考えるより、実際やってみる方が\n早いもんねっ。みんな、準備はいい？", "zh": "嗯！与其想那么多，不如实际行动看看还比较快。\n大家准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1052_013hib", "source_sha256": "44ddd3f6cdc26d0fb348f7c5f5c9db7d42d26e6ae188b660edc5bc62da9e080c", "ja": "レジェンドデイズ！\n活動開始さー！", "zh": "『Legend Days』！\n开始活动啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1053_007ior", "source_sha256": "8a2db7b87c98e78fc6b98f4e27b3ed4af8670e762d92883722807a128ab14fa0", "ja": "お～っ！", "zh": "喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
