{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1056_011ami", "source_sha256": "8a2db7b87c98e78fc6b98f4e27b3ed4af8670e762d92883722807a128ab14fa0", "ja": "お～っ！", "zh": "喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1057_p", "source_sha256": "cdc2856dd04c3e79ca32f78af609739c09d4347ef97ab20d7678dd8c5749a192", "ja": "（いい雰囲気だな。この5人のユニットなら、\n本当に伝説を作ってしまうかもしれない）", "zh": "（气氛真不错。这五人组成的团体\n说不定真的会创造传说。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_01_1058_p", "source_sha256": "f2de492c0e225f41f505c01c0263b16301d904371329df678897395694fa3281", "ja": "（みんなにとっても、新しい挑戦だ。\nしっかりプロデュースして行こう！）", "zh": "（这对大家来说也是一个新挑战，\n我要好好培育她们！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
